  "sculpt": {
    "_about": "THE OX (2026-11-05): a draught ox -- the cattle body plan heavier: a deep barrel on a straight back, a muscled hump of shoulder over the withers, the hip bones and pins under the hide, a deep dewlap swinging from the throat to the brisket; a broad flat forehead under the poll, a long face to a broad wet muzzle (pale), big jaws, ears straight out under the long horns; stout legs to the dewclaws and two broad toes; the horns and the tufted tail kept (2026-11-08) The HORNS are the engine's sharp `horn` (sharp.js; tools/creaturegen/sharp/horns.py merged the field part and its slender detail tip into one centreline): smooth, sunk in the skull, a true point. (2026-11-08, ears2.py) The EARS (ears2.py): broad LEAVES held out sideways (sharp.js `fin`), the hollow forward and down; the roots faired. (2026-11-08, tools/creaturegen/sweep/tails.py) The TAIL is one `sweep` (sculpt.js) along its bones, not a chain of cones blended one into the next: no beads, its thin end exact rings.",
